<h1>Agent Canvas/Canvas &amp; Execution/ &mdash; Canvas &amp; Execution</h1>
<div class="hero">
  <p class="subtitle">Core execution engine for DAG-based workflows</p>
  <p>Graph base class and Canvas subclass; JSON DSL parsing; backward compatibility via dsl_migration.py; topological sorting O(V+E); lazy variable resolution via attribute paths; output caching; immutable history tracking for audit trails.</p>
