<p><strong>Line-by-line:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>dsl_migration.migrate():</strong> Handles legacy DSL versions (e.g., v1.0 → v2.0); users don't need to manually upgrade old workflows.</li>
  <li><strong>component_registry.get():</strong> Looks up factory function by component type name; if not found, raises error early at load-time, not execution-time.</li>
  <li><strong>self._validate_dag():</strong> Checks for cycles using DFS; ensures all tool references exist in tool registry; validates parameter types against component schema.</li>
  <li><strong>nodes[id].config → factory():</strong> Component factory receives config dict; factory is responsible for validating and storing parameters; separation of concerns.</li>
  <li><strong>self._edges storage:</strong> Edges are indexed by destination node; enables fast dependency lookup during execution (O(E) to build, O(1) per lookup).</li><!-- Add annotations for 5-10 key lines -->
</ul>
